lines = PackedStringArray("They say the barrier over the villages is asleep. Who's next?", "More refugees at the gate again. Where will we put them all?", "Don't look up too long. My neighbour's eyes went blue.", "A blue-eyed one wandered the market yesterday. Didn't know his own name.", "Bread costs twice what it did in spring.", "Water's dearer than oil these days.", "The mayor sees no one. The queue's been there since dawn.", "The mayor counts coins while the city counts refugees.", "Mind the cart, stranger!", "Samal keep you, traveller.")

